        <detaileddescription>
<para>Decodes a 64-bit integer from its ZigZag-encoded unsigned representation. ZigZag maps signed integers to unsigned values so that small negative numbers have a short varint encoding: 0 -&gt; 0, -1 -&gt; 1, 1 -&gt; 2, -2 -&gt; 3, ... </para>
